      "quantity": "one packed shadow mask per screen pixel: 4 bits per light slot for up to PackedShadowMaskMaxLightCount lights (16 in capture -> 2 dwords)",
      "units": "quantized shadow factor: 0..15 maps linearly to 0..1 (0=fully shadowed, 15=fully lit)",
      "coordinateSpace": "view-rect pixel (same extent as SceneColor); light slot index follows the pruned light grid's per-pixel light order",
      "storage": {
